WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.905
Mastery Starter 0.0.

00:00:02.905 --> 00:00:04.910
New to Crypto From Zero?

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:05.970
Start here.

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:08.057
In about ten minutes, you'll go from

00:00:08.057 --> 00:00:09.750
zero to ready for this module.

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:13.458
Crypto is money recorded on a public

00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:16.100
ledger that nobody can quietly edit.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.816
You'll open an exchange account, buy a little

00:00:18.816 --> 00:00:21.119
crypto, move it into a wallet only you

00:00:21.119 --> 00:00:24.426
control, and make your first practice DeFi transaction,

00:00:24.426 --> 00:00:26.788
all with a small amount and a checklist.

00:00:28.088 --> 00:00:32.048
Blockchain: a shared ledger kept by thousands of computers.

00:00:32.048 --> 00:00:34.006
Wallet: an app or device holding

00:00:34.006 --> 00:00:36.323
the keys that control your crypto.

00:00:36.323 --> 00:00:40.008
Seed phrase: 12–24 words that are your wallet.

00:00:40.008 --> 00:00:41.088
Never share.

00:00:41.088 --> 00:00:44.578
Exchange: a company that swaps your money for crypto.

00:00:44.578 --> 00:00:46.943
Gas: the network fee for a transaction.

00:00:48.243 --> 00:00:50.534
First, A phone, a computer, ID

00:00:50.534 --> 00:00:52.608
for KYC, a bank account.

00:00:52.608 --> 00:00:57.603
Next, $50–$200 you can afford to lose while learning.

00:00:57.603 --> 00:01:00.378
And finally, 2–3 hours over a few days.

00:01:01.678 --> 00:01:04.761
Read Lesson 0.1, then secure your email

00:01:04.761 --> 00:01:08.838
with a unique password and authenticator-app 2FA.

00:01:08.838 --> 00:01:10.133
No money needed yet.

00:01:11.433 --> 00:01:14.152
Beginner: Can explain blockchain, wallet and

00:01:14.152 --> 00:01:16.083
seed phrase in plain words.

00:01:16.083 --> 00:01:18.356
Practitioner: Has a secured exchange

00:01:18.356 --> 00:01:20.868
account and a restore-tested wallet.

00:01:20.868 --> 00:01:23.454
Master: Completes the whole Day-1 Setup Kit

00:01:23.454 --> 00:01:25.453
and can coach a friend through it.

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:29.345
You've mastered this module when every box

00:01:29.345 --> 00:01:31.335
of the Day-1 Setup Kit is ticked.

00:01:32.635 --> 00:01:35.150
Do the checklist now, before you move on.

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:37.469
Next up, Lesson 0.1: Money,

00:01:37.469 --> 00:01:40.286
ledgers and why blockchains exist.
